{"product_id":"heiresses","title":"Heiresses","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Trevellyan heiresses are the height of success, glamour and style. But when it comes to wealth, Jemima's indulgent lifestyle knows no limits; Tara's one purpose in life is to be financially independent of her family and husband; and Poppy wants to escape its trappings without losing the comfort their family money brings.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Lulu Taylor\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099524939\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45169064706201,"sku":"3RB9780099524939","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67b89f7a74119_Heiresses_20Lulu_20Taylor_20_1.jpg?v=1740217915","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/heiresses","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}